---
/**
 * Static topology of the web dashboard (guide/dashboard): browser, the
 * all-in-one dashboard process (UI server + control agent) and the bunqueue
 * server. The figcaption carries the full description, so the boxes are
 * decorative for assistive technology.
 */
---

<figure class="dash-arch not-content">
  <div class="da-row" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="da-node">
      <span class="da-kicker">Browser</span>
      <span class="da-title">Dashboard UI</span>
      <span class="da-sub">React SPA · polling + SSE</span>
      <span class="da-sub">Tokens held for the session only</span>
    </div>

    <div class="da-link">
      <span class="da-link-label">HTTP<br /><span>same origin</span></span>
    </div>

    <div class="da-node da-node-accent">
      <span class="da-kicker"><code>bunx bunqueue-dashboard</code></span>
      <div class="da-part">
        <span class="da-title">UI server <code>:8080</code></span>
        <span class="da-sub">Serves assets · proxies <code>/api/*</code></span>
      </div>
      <div class="da-part">
        <span class="da-title">Control agent <code>127.0.0.1:6800</code></span>
        <span class="da-sub">Process lifecycle · SDK bridges · SQLite reads · S3 backups</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="da-link">
      <span class="da-link-label">HTTP 6790<br /><span>TCP 6789</span></span>
    </div>

    <div class="da-node">
      <span class="da-kicker">Self-hosted</span>
      <span class="da-title">bunqueue server</span>
      <span class="da-sub">HTTP API + SSE on <code>:6790</code></span>
      <span class="da-sub">TCP clients on <code>:6789</code></span>
      <span class="da-sub">SQLite or PostgreSQL</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    Apart from optional Copilot calls to your AI provider, the browser talks only to the dashboard
    process. Its UI server proxies <code>/api/*</code> to the
    bunqueue HTTP API on port 6790. The control agent stays on loopback and handles process control,
    Queue, Flow and Workflow SDK bridges over TCP, SQLite inspection and backups.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  /* The layout follows the figure's own width, which already excludes the sidebar and the
     table of contents, so it stacks whenever the content column is narrow. */
  .dash-arch {
    margin: 2rem 0;
    container-type: inline-size;
  }

  .da-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 5.5rem minmax(0, 1.25fr) 5.5rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .da-node {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--sl-color-bg-nav);
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .da-node-accent {
    border-color: var(--sl-color-accent);
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .da-part {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    padding-top: 0.7rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline);
  }

  .da-kicker {
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .da-kicker code {
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .da-title {
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 650;
  }

  .da-sub {
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .dash-arch code {
    padding: 0 0.25em;
    font-size: 0.85em;
  }

  .da-title code {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* A connector is a centered rule with an arrowhead and a label above it. */
  .da-link {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .da-link::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 6px;
    right: 6px;
    top: 50%;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--sl-color-gray-4);
  }

  .da-link::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    right: 4px;
    top: calc(50% - 4px);
    border: 4px solid transparent;
    border-left: 6px solid var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  }

  .da-link-label {
    position: relative;
    top: -1.3rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .dash-arch figcaption {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @container (max-width: 760px) {
    .da-row {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .da-link {
      min-height: 3rem;
    }

    .da-link::before {
      left: 50%;
      right: auto;
      top: 6px;
      bottom: 6px;
      border-top: 0;
      border-left: 1px dashed var(--sl-color-gray-4);
    }

    .da-link::after {
      right: auto;
      left: calc(50% - 4px);
      top: auto;
      bottom: 2px;
      border: 4px solid transparent;
      border-top: 6px solid var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    }

    .da-link-label {
      top: 0;
      left: 0.9rem;
      padding-left: 50%;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .da-link-label br {
      display: none;
    }

    .da-link-label span::before {
      content: ' · ';
    }
  }
</style>
